  "body": "Perched above the sparkling waters of Stanmore Bay, 29 Duncansby Road is a home that captures the essence of relaxed coastal living. Thoughtfully reimagined, this architecturally designed residence beautifully balances the charm of the original seaside bach with the comfort and sophistication of modern living.\r\n\r\nFilled with natural light and positioned to embrace sweeping sea views, the home has been designed with both family life and entertaining in mind. The two-level layout offers a wonderful sense of space and flexibility, with separate living zones creating privacy while still feeling connected. Upstairs, the master suite, an additional bedroom and a second living area provide a peaceful retreat, while the lower level forms the heart of the home, where open-plan living flows effortlessly to the outdoors and the ever-changing outlook beyond.\r\n\r\nFeatures to appreciate include:\r\n\r\n- Elevated position with panoramic sea views from both levels, creating a stunning coastal backdrop throughout the day\r\n- A thoughtful layout offering flexibility, privacy and distinct living spaces across two floors\r\n- Open-plan kitchen, dining, living and bar area opening through stacker doors to a generous entertaining deck\r\n- Glass balustrades to the main deck and upper balcony, enhancing the connection to the sea and maximising the views\r\n- Beautiful pitched ceilings upstairs that add character and fill the home with natural light\r\n- Spacious bathrooms with underfloor heating for year-round comfort\r\n- Double garage with additional off-street parking\r\n- Private 809sqm landscaped grounds with established subtropical gardens and easy-care planting\r\n\r\nLocated just moments from local beaches, Coast Plaza, Silverdale Shopping Centre, cafe's and restaurants, this is a home that offers both convenience and an enviable lifestyle. Whether it is gathering with family and friends, finding a quiet spot to unwind, or simply enjoying the ever-changing view across the bay, 29 Duncansby Road is a place that feels warm, welcoming and effortlessly connected to its coastal surroundings.",
